# Forever game-type TOC. The client loads this instead of AHDressingRoomHelper.toc
# when it still recognizes the Camelot suffix. Same addon either way.
# The wiki said this suffix may be renamed at launch; the unsuffixed file
# is the fallback and declares the same interface number.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: Auction House Dressing Room Helper
## Notes: Hide auction-house gear tooltips while you preview, optionally close the Dressing Room with the auction house, and optionally dim bag items that cannot be posted.
## Author: AH Dressing Room Helper
## Version: 1.3.0
## SavedVariables: AHDressingRoomHelperDB
## Category: Auction & Economy
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Coin_01

